  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 17797189632
    m_Localized: PERFECT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521280
    m_Localized: HIGH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521281
    m_Localized: MEDIUM
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521282
    m_Localized: LOW
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17847521283
    m_Localized: ZERO
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763233173504
    m_Localized: READ
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367808
    m_Localized: SHARE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 9763237367809
    m_Localized: SKIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721479
    m_Localized: Hello! This message would be a reaction to the article you just
      sent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721480
    m_Localized: I am an acquaintance of yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721481
    m_Localized: In fact, I do not exist and I have nothing to do with anyone you
      know in real life with my name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721482
    m_Localized: Good morning! I am another of your acquaintances.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721483
    m_Localized: In this chat we'll be telling you what your articles makes us feel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721484
    m_Localized: For now, we'll be going back to the page you were on before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721485
    m_Localized: To do that, I need you to press the button in the top right of the
      screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 410822783721486
    m_Localized: Try it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618628841472
    m_Localized: SOURCE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978816
    m_Localized: NEXT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978817
    m_Localized: This is the body of the article. This is where you can read all
      the important information about the news story. It is very important that you
      read it, because it can clarify much of what the headline tells us, preventing
      us from falling for falsehoods so easily. Thank you for reading!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 414618674978818
    m_Localized: This is the article's Title.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416448
    m_Localized: FAMILY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416449
    m_Localized: FRIENDS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 426683309416450
    m_Localized: NEIGHBOURS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 427584111697920
    m_Localized: Have you seen this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335212883968
    m_Localized: I had already seen it, but thank you anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992832
    m_Localized: Michael had already sent it to me. I think we're going to ask for
      something, let's see if it works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992833
    m_Localized: Please don't share this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992834
    m_Localized: This is a scam, please don't fall for it. They just want your information.
      The government doesn't offer grants like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992835
    m_Localized: Thank you for sharing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1427335279992836
    m_Localized: Thank you! The food in the bar's freezer went bad, so this money
      will come in handy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960068800512
    m_Localized: You have shared a fake new.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103680
    m_Localized: Haven't you noticed how it was written?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103681
    m_Localized: You should read the news you are sharing. Sharing fake news may
      cause grave consequences
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103682
    m_Localized: You have shared a true new.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1449960140103683
    m_Localized: You were lucky enough that it was true, because you didn't read
      it. You should reed the news you share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815863758848
    m_Localized: Welcome to Level UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896192
    m_Localized: Choose your language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815909896193
    m_Localized: This is Level UP!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090496
    m_Localized: In this game, you will interact with different groups that will
      send you news, blogs, and social media posts. You can interact with them by
      forwarding news to them (or not!) and see how they react to what you send them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090497
    m_Localized: Let's go!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090498
    m_Localized: Has the blackout affected you? Here is how you can receive a compensation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090499
    m_Localized: New notification
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1470815914090500
    m_Localized: Open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1805145240690688
    m_Localized: Your Influence
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
